# apps/hq-desktop/src-tauri is a Cargo workspace member (see Cargo.toml) —
# `cargo build -p hq-cli` still needs its manifest to resolve the workspace
# graph even though it isn't built, so exclude the other apps/* dirs
# individually instead of the whole apps/ tree.
